cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "rEMVBH-reproduction: Reproduction package for `Rotation overcharges vectorized black holes'"
abstract: >-
  Data, derived equations, verification scripts, unit tests and plotting code
  reproducing the numerical results of the paper "Rotation overcharges
  vectorized black holes" (rotating solutions of the Einstein--Maxwell--Vector
  model). Running `python3 run_all.py` executes the full verification pipeline
  (46 checks, 0 failures).
